            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif' fontsize='11'>*Glovo &amp; Greece are included to the Global AQS from July’24 onwards</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
