    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='ScoreCard Calculation'>
      <repository-location derived-from='http://ip-172-31-0-212:8362/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/AssortmentQualityScoreCard_P/ScoreCardCalculation?rev=' id='ScoreCardCalculation' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/AssortmentQualityScoreCard_P' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='1350' maxwidth='1000' minheight='1350' minwidth='1000' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='6' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4593' id='5' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='11259'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='18'>How is the Score calculated?</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='9111' id='7' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='15852'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>To calculate the final score, the evaluation considers eight Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) displayed below. For each warehouse per month, these KPIs are assigned a specific score ranging from 0 to 10. The scores are then multiplied by the corresponding weight assigned to each KPI, and the results are summed to generate the final score, which falls within the range of 0 to 100. The image below provides a visual representation of the weights and scores assigned to each KPI, facilitating a clearer understanding of the calculation process.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='10666' id='45' is-centered='0' is-scaled='1' param='Image/DH-Logo_Tableau 1.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='14400' x='800' y='593'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='10666' id='46' type-v2='text' w='84000' x='15200' y='593'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='32'>Assortment Quality Scorecard</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16'>Calculations and Definitions</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='11'>D-Marts QCommerce</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6074' id='47' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='39630'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='18'>Metrics: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#ea565f' fontsize='14' italic='true'>Definitions &amp; Calculations</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='53703' id='48' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='45704'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true' underline='true'>Imput Metrics</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true'>*KEEP IN MIND: Input metrics assess the performance of each warehouse. However, when looking at a country, regional, or global level, they are calculated by taking the weighted average of the warehouse input metric and  the GPV.  Warehouses are considered in this report  if (1) iwarehouse maturity is greater than 90 days and (2) are not closed/to close warehouses.  </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Listed SKUs</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Number of listed SKUs at the last day of the month (only mature warehouses are considered)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>1. For coutries with Status Hierarchy, since 2023-07-01 a listed SKU follows this rule: (SH-ACTIVE OR (SH-ON_HOLD AND on_hand_qty&gt;0) AND NOT stale_sku)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>2. For coutries without Status Hierarchy a listed SKU follows this rule: (is_active from catalog AND NOT stale_sku)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Efficiency %</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Number of listed SKUs older than 90 days with an average unit sold &gt;= 1 per warehouse-week / Number of listed SKUs older than 90 days without Low Availability.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>*</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'><![CDATA[Low Availability: Zero Movers with availability <100% and Slow Movers with availability <80%]]></run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Outfit' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Avg. Coverage L3 Categories</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: The average number of  listed Level 3 Categories / total number Level 3 Categories per country. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'>*Categories containing words with &quot;Other&quot;/&quot;Others&quot; are not counted</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>UltraFresh Basket Penetration %:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> Baskets containing at least one UltraFresh SKU / overall baskets.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'>*Ultrafresh categories: Produce, Ready to Consume and Meat/Seafood</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Efficient Listings %:  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'><![CDATA[Number of SKUs < 90 days old with an average unit sold >= 1 per warehouse-week / Number of listed SKUs]]></run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Instock %: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Weighted Availability (</run>
              <run auto-url='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Mp6G1YViQ-QXS9PYs6JEAVskQRUFpxRlhTCG46HRnP0/edit#heading=h.ozojod1rdozz&amp;quot;'>https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Mp6G1YViQ-QXS9PYs6JEAVskQRUFpxRlhTCG46HRnP0/edit#heading=h.ozojod1rdozz</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Discontinued Book Value:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>1. For regions with Status Hierarchy: Book Value of not listed SKUs (Discontinued) / Total Warehouse Book Value</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>2. For regions without Status Hierarchy: Book Value of Long Term Zero Movers (labeled as ZMs consistently during the last three months) / Total Warehouse Book Value</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true' underline='true'>Perception Metrics</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Content Score: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Average of aggregated completeness and quality metrics score (For WHs the country&apos;s Content Score is shown)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>GPV Share: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Share of GPV based on total whs/countries/regions displayed (Be aware that calculation is along table, meaning that if you manually select some countries, the GPV share will be recalculated based only on those selected) </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true' underline='true'>Output Metrics</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>ABV:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> Average Basket Value:  Total GPV / Number of orders</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>ABS:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> Average Basket Size:  Total Items Sold / Number of orders</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>ODS</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Orders per Day per Store</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Frequency</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Number of Orders / Number of Unique Customers</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>CVR (Dmart homepage to Transaction)</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Conversion rate i.e total number of sessions with transactions/total number of sessions (For WHs the country&apos;s CVR is shown)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'>*Using Perseus Data since  August 2023</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='14667' id='503' is-scaled='1' param='Image/AQS_V6_Instructions_20241223.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='98400' x='800' y='24963'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='1739' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='84000' id='1738' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='84000' x='8000' y='8000'>
                <zone fixed-size='136' h='10666' id='45' is-centered='0' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/DH-Logo_Tableau 1.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='14400' x='800' y='593'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='10666' id='46' type-v2='text' w='84000' x='15200' y='593'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='32'>Assortment Quality Scorecard</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16'>Calculations and Definitions</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='11'>D-Marts QCommerce</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4593' id='5' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='11259'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='18'>How is the Score calculated?</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='9111' id='7' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='15852'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>To calculate the final score, the evaluation considers eight Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) displayed below. For each warehouse per month, these KPIs are assigned a specific score ranging from 0 to 10. The scores are then multiplied by the corresponding weight assigned to each KPI, and the results are summed to generate the final score, which falls within the range of 0 to 100. The image below provides a visual representation of the weights and scores assigned to each KPI, facilitating a clearer understanding of the calculation process.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='190' h='14667' id='503' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/AQS_V6_Instructions_20241223.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='98400' x='800' y='24963'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6074' id='47' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='39630'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='18'>Metrics: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ea565f' fontsize='14' italic='true'>Definitions &amp; Calculations</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='53703' id='48' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='45704'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true' underline='true'>Imput Metrics</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true'>*KEEP IN MIND: Input metrics assess the performance of each warehouse. However, when looking at a country, regional, or global level, they are calculated by taking the weighted average of the warehouse input metric and  the GPV.  Warehouses are considered in this report  if (1) iwarehouse maturity is greater than 90 days and (2) are not closed/to close warehouses.  </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Listed SKUs</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Number of listed SKUs at the last day of the month (only mature warehouses are considered)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>1. For coutries with Status Hierarchy, since 2023-07-01 a listed SKU follows this rule: (SH-ACTIVE OR (SH-ON_HOLD AND on_hand_qty&gt;0) AND NOT stale_sku)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>2. For coutries without Status Hierarchy a listed SKU follows this rule: (is_active from catalog AND NOT stale_sku)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Efficiency %</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Number of listed SKUs older than 90 days with an average unit sold &gt;= 1 per warehouse-week / Number of listed SKUs older than 90 days without Low Availability.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>*</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'><![CDATA[Low Availability: Zero Movers with availability <100% and Slow Movers with availability <80%]]></run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Outfit' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Avg. Coverage L3 Categories</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: The average number of  listed Level 3 Categories / total number Level 3 Categories per country. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'>*Categories containing words with &quot;Other&quot;/&quot;Others&quot; are not counted</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>UltraFresh Basket Penetration %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> Baskets containing at least one UltraFresh SKU / overall baskets.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'>*Ultrafresh categories: Produce, Ready to Consume and Meat/Seafood</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Efficient Listings %:  </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'><![CDATA[Number of SKUs < 90 days old with an average unit sold >= 1 per warehouse-week / Number of listed SKUs]]></run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Instock %: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Weighted Availability (</run>
                    <run auto-url='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Mp6G1YViQ-QXS9PYs6JEAVskQRUFpxRlhTCG46HRnP0/edit#heading=h.ozojod1rdozz&amp;quot;'>https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Mp6G1YViQ-QXS9PYs6JEAVskQRUFpxRlhTCG46HRnP0/edit#heading=h.ozojod1rdozz</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Discontinued Book Value:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>1. For regions with Status Hierarchy: Book Value of not listed SKUs (Discontinued) / Total Warehouse Book Value</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>2. For regions without Status Hierarchy: Book Value of Long Term Zero Movers (labeled as ZMs consistently during the last three months) / Total Warehouse Book Value</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true' underline='true'>Perception Metrics</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Content Score: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Average of aggregated completeness and quality metrics score (For WHs the country&apos;s Content Score is shown)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>GPV Share: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Share of GPV based on total whs/countries/regions displayed (Be aware that calculation is along table, meaning that if you manually select some countries, the GPV share will be recalculated based only on those selected) </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true' underline='true'>Output Metrics</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>ABV:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> Average Basket Value:  Total GPV / Number of orders</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>ABS:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> Average Basket Size:  Total Items Sold / Number of orders</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>ODS</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Orders per Day per Store</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Frequency</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Number of Orders / Number of Unique Customers</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>CVR (Dmart homepage to Transaction)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Conversion rate i.e total number of sessions with transactions/total number of sessions (For WHs the country&apos;s CVR is shown)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'>*Using Perseus Data since  August 2023</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{7B2EBC5B-73B2-4077-B3BF-0962E6BC7DE8}' />
    </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
